{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPedal\/usesLines"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"title":"usesLines","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLPedalV9usesLinesSbSgvp","symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"usesLines","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}]},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"usesLines"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Maps to the MusicXML "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"line"},{"type":"text","text":" attribute."}]}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A Boolean value indicating whether pedal lines are used."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlpedal\/useslines"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPedal"]]},"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLPedal/usesLines":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPedal\/usesLines","role":"symbol","title":"usesLines","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlpedal\/useslines","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A Boolean value indicating whether pedal lines are used."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"usesLines"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}]},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLPedal":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlpedal","abstract":[{"text":"The pedal type represents piano pedal marks, including damper and sostenuto pedal marks. The line attribute is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"yes if pedal lines are used. The sign attribute is yes if Ped, Sost, and * signs are used. For compatibility","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with older versions, the sign attribute is yes by default if the line attribute is no, and is no by default if"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the line attribute is yes. If the sign attribute is set to yes and the type is start or sostenuto, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"abbreviated attribute is yes if the short P and S signs are used, and no if the full Ped and Sost signs are","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"used. It is no by default. Otherwise the abbreviated attribute is ignored. The alignment attributes are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ignored if the sign attribute is no."}],"title":"MXLPedal","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPedal","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLPedal","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLPedal","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"type":"topic","title":"IvorMXL","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}],"role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl"}}}